flowchart TD
    A[Write / edit HCL files<br/>provider, vpc, ec2, user-data...] --> B[terraform init<br/>download provider]
    B --> C[terraform fmt -recursive<br/>format code]
    C --> C1{validate passes?}
    C1 -->|no| C2[fix HCL syntax / errors] --> C
    C1 -->|yes| D[terraform plan<br/>show intended changes]
    D --> D1{plan shows what you expect?}
    D1 -->|no| D2[fix config or vars] --> D
    D1 -->|yes| E[Human approves]
    E --> F[terraform apply<br/>create infrastructure]
    F --> G[verify: terraform output<br/>curl http://public_ip]
    G --> H{destroy?}
    H -->|not yet| I[continue improving / drift check]
    H -->|yes| J[terraform destroy]
    J --> K[verify cleanup<br/>AWS console empty]
